Module: Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Floor
Name: Int.sub_floor_div_mul_lt
Description: For any element $a$ in a linearly ordered ring $k$ and any positive element $b \in k$, the difference $a - \lfloor a / b \rfloor \cdot b$ is strictly less than $b$, i.e.,
