f
   =\frac{1-2a-\frac{r}{s}}{2a}
   =\frac{(s-r)^{2}}{2s^{2}}\;\Big/\;
     \frac{s^{2}-r^{2}}{2s^{2}}
   =\frac{s-r}{s+r}. \tag{11}
\]

