From (12) and (14) we obtain the precise description

\[
S=\Bigl\{\,n\;\frac{2s}{s+r}\;\Big|\;n=1,\dots ,N\Bigr\}. \tag{16}
\]

Using the standard formula for the sum of the first `N` integers
