   rational equals that natural, and *Rat.ofInt_eq_cast* guarantees the
   usual integer embedding; both are compatible with the reduction just
   performed.)

10. **Compute the required sum.**  

    \[
    m.\text{den}+m.\text{num}=2+175=177 .
    \]

    This is exactly the statement to be proved.

--------------------------------------------------------------------

Hence, under the given hypotheses, we have shown that  
\(\displaystyle \uparrow m.\text{den}+m.\text{num}=177\). ∎

