Key features:
- `ring_nf!` uses a more aggressive reducibility setting to identify atoms
- Configurable options include:
  - `red`: the reducibility setting (overridden by `!`)
  - `recursive`: when true, recurses into atoms
- Works in both tactic mode and conversion mode
