1. [THEOREM] Recursive formula for factorial: $(n+1)! = (n+1) \cdot n!$
Module: Mathlib.Data.Nat.Factorial.Basic
Name: Nat.factorial_succ
Description: For any natural number $n$, the factorial of $n+1$ is equal to $(n+1)$ multiplied by the factorial of $n$, i.e., $(n+1)! = (n+1) \cdot n!$.
Signature:  (n : ℕ) : (n + 1)! = (n + 1) * n !

2. [THEOREM] Power Recursion: $a^{n+1} = a^n \cdot a$
Module: Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Defs
Name: pow_succ
Description: For any element $a$ in a monoid $M$ and any natural number $n$, the $(n+1)$-th power of $a$ equals the $n$-th power of $a$ multiplied by $a$, i.e., $a^{n+1} = a^n \cdot a$.
Signature:  (a : M) (n : ℕ) : a ^ (n + 1) = a ^ n * a

3. [THEOREM] Recursive Power Identity: $a^{n+1} = a \cdot a^n$
Module: Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Defs
Name: pow_succ'
Description: For any element $a$ in a monoid $M$ and any natural number $n$, the $(n+1)$-th power of $a$ equals $a$ multiplied by the $n$-th power of $a$, i.e., $a^{n+1} = a \cdot a^n$.
Signature:  (a : M) : ∀ n, a ^ (n + 1) = a * a ^ n
