5. [THEOREM] Affine Combination of Slopes via Line Map: $\text{lineMap}(\text{slope}\,f\,a\,b, \text{slope}\,f\,b\,c)(\frac{c-b}{c-a}) = \text{slope}\,f\,a\,c$
