Module: Mathlib.Data.Int.Defs
Name: Int.inductionOn'_self
Description: For any integer $b$ and properties $H_0$, $H_s$, $H_p$, the induction principle applied to the base case $b$ yields $H_0$, i.e., $\text{inductionOn'}(b, H_0, H_s, H_p) = H_0$.
