2. [THEOREM] Affine Combination of Slopes via Intermediate Point: $\text{lineMap}(\text{slope}\,f\,(\text{lineMap}\,a\,b\,r)\,b,\ \text{slope}\,f\,a\,(\text{lineMap}\,a\,b\,r))(r) = \text{slope}\,f\,a\,b$
