Description: For any function $f \colon k \to PE$ from a field $k$ to an affine space $PE$ over $k$, and for any points $a, b, r \in k$, the affine combination of the slopes $\text{slope}\,f\,(\text{lineMap}\,a\,b\,r)\,b$ and $\text{slope}\,f\,a\,(\text{lineMap}\,a\,b\,r)$ with weight $r$ equals the slope $\text{slope}\,f\,a\,b$. 

